  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Add --shell-quote option by @aaronriekenberg in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/151\r\n* enable lto in release build by @aaronriekenberg in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/109\r\n* Bump either from 1.15.0 to 1.16.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/99\r\n* Bump memchr from 2.8.0 to 2.8.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/102\r\n* Refactor input::task to pipeline architecture: read → parse → shell-wrap → send by @aaronriekenberg with @Copilot in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/105\r\n* Fix clippy bool_assert_comparison errors by @aaronriekenberg with @Copilot in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/108\r\n* Bump memchr from 2.8.1 to 2.8.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/112\r\n* Bump smallvec from 1.15.1 to 1.15.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/113\r\n* Bump itertools from 0.14.0 to 0.15.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/115\r\n* Bump which from 8.0.3 to 8.0.4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/114\r\n* Bump actions/checkout from 6 to 7 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/116\r\n* Bump bytes from 1.11.1 to 1.12.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/117\r\n* Bump actions/cache from 5 to 6 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/119\r\n* Bump bstr from 1.12.2 to 1.12.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/120\r\n* Bump anyhow from 1.0.102 to 1.0.103 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/121\r\n* Bump indicatif from 0.18.5 to 0.18.6 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/124\r\n* Bump console from 0.16.3 to 0.16.4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/123\r\n* Bump bytesize from 2.4.0 to 2.4.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/125\r\n* Bump memchr from 2.8.2 to 2.8.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/127\r\n* Bump bytes from 1.12.0 to 1.12.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/126\r\n* Bump regex from 1.12.4 to 1.13.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/128\r\n* Bump regex-automata from 0.4.14 to 0.4.15 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/129\r\n* Bump tokio from 1.52.3 to 1.52.4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/135\r\n* Bump tokio-macros from 2.7.1 to 2.7.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/144\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @aaronriekenberg with @Copilot made their first contribution in https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/pull/105\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/aaronriekenberg/rust-parallel/compare/v1.23.0...v1.24.0",
